#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Introduction {#1-introduction}"
msgstr "1. Pengenalan {#1-introduction}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Throughout this lesson, we will examine noise and how it can be mitigated on quantum computers. We will begin by looking at the effects of noise using a simulator that can simulate noise in a few ways, including using noise profiles from real quantum computers. Then we will move on to real quantum computers, in which noise is inherent. We will look at the effects of error mitigation, including combinations of things like zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE) and gate-twirling.\n"
msgstr "Sepanjang pelajaran ini, kita akan memeriksa noise dan cara mitigasinya pada komputer kuantum. Kita akan mulai dengan melihat efek noise menggunakan simulator yang bisa mensimulasikan noise dengan beberapa cara, termasuk menggunakan profil noise dari komputer kuantum nyata. Lalu kita akan beralih ke komputer kuantum nyata, di mana noise adalah hal yang inheren. Kita akan melihat efek mitigasi error, termasuk kombinasi hal-hal seperti zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE) dan gate-twirling.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will start by loading some packages.\n"
msgstr "Kita mulai dengan memuat beberapa paket.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Noisy simulation without error mitigation {#2-noisy-simulation-without-error-mitigation}"
msgstr "2. Simulasi berisik tanpa mitigasi error {#2-noisy-simulation-without-error-mitigation}"

