msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/error-mitigation/extracted-outputs/20296b5a-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: As shown above, the circuit with $k$ time steps will have $4k$ two-qubit gate layers.\n"
msgstr "Catatan: Seperti yang ditunjukkan di atas, Circuit dengan $k$ langkah waktu akan memiliki $4k$ lapisan Gate dua-Qubit.\n"

